Good — now that I see your actual schema from the screenshots, we can keep most of your design intact and only add the cycle participation table. That way we reuse what you already have:

Existing tables (from your design):

LH_CLO_HEDGE

LH_CLO_HEDGE_ALLOCATIONS

LH_CLO_PROGRAM

LH_CLO_REPLENISHMENT_CYCLE

LH_LOAN_INVENTORY_DAILY / MONTHLY


Add one table only:

LH_CLO_CYCLE_HEDGE_PARTICIPATION

And then define all operational queries Camunda will run.


