3. Query — Hedge Available Amount in a Cycle

This is the most used query for allocation UI.

SELECT
p.cycle_id,
p.hedge_id,
p.cycle_supply_amt
    - COALESCE(SUM(a.amount),0) remaining_amt
FROM LH_CLO_CYCLE_HEDGE_PARTICIPATION p
LEFT JOIN LH_CLO_HEDGE_ALLOCATIONS a
ON p.hedge_id = a.hedge_id
AND a.allocation_cycle_id = p.cycle_id
WHERE p.cycle_id = :cycle_id
GROUP BY
p.cycle_id,
p.hedge_id,
p.cycle_supply_amt;


