6. Query — Allocation of a Hedge Across Programs

SELECT
a.program_id,
SUM(
CASE
WHEN a.txn_type = 'INCREASE' THEN a.amount
WHEN a.txn_type = 'REDUCE' THEN -a.amount
END
) allocated_amt
FROM LH_CLO_HEDGE_ALLOCATIONS a
WHERE a.hedge_id = :hedge_id
AND a.allocation_cycle_id = :cycle_id
GROUP BY a.program_id;

Result example:

program	allocated

P1	3M
P2	2M



